      <definition>v. i. To feel ashamed; to shun, avoid, be unsociable.</definition>
      <page>1085</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠨᠢᠭᠤᠷ ᠵᠥᠯᠴᠢᠯᠵᠡᠺᠥ</unicode>
          <transcript>niγur --ky</transcript>
          <definition>To turn away one's face in shame, feel dishonored, show shame; to be ashamed.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
